(7538969, 1206242, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, well composed, the processing doesn''t hurt or help IMO...   I like the wide view. Not sure if the blur is in camera or PS but I might enjoy seeing the original frame.  Oh well. 8 anyway.<br/> <br/>edit to add... just remembered the expert edit was available. That doesn''t change my vote.</td>', 'Nice scene, well composed, the processing doesn''t hurt or help IMO...   I like the wide view. Not sure if the blur is in camera or PS but I might enjoy seeing the original frame.  Oh well. 8 anyway. edit to add... just remembered the expert edit was available. That doesn''t change my vote.', '2017-10-12 12:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7538970, 1206391, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess this is expert edit at it''s best, if not then that man has lost his marbles!!!  Geez. What a sight to behold (hahahaha... for us, not him - we hope).</td>', 'I''m gonna guess this is expert edit at it''s best, if not then that man has lost his marbles!!!  Geez. What a sight to behold (hahahaha... for us, not him - we hope).', '2017-10-12 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
