(7539009, 1206318, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love the Broncos cap. I betcha this is a ribbon, even if it IS the first one in my queue. I''ll give it a 10, with the proviso that if the challenge is FULL of quality images you might end up being demoted to a 9, OK? But I doubt it :-)<br/> <br/>ETA: Your 10 is safe :-)<br/> <br/>ETA: You''ve been joined by another 10, rare for me. YOU are the most imaginative entry in the challenge hands-down, however :-) I want to give you my rarely-awarded Golden Paw:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762723" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Love the Broncos cap. I betcha this is a ribbon, even if it IS the first one in my queue. I''ll give it a 10, with the proviso that if the challenge is FULL of quality images you might end up being demoted to a 9, OK? But I doubt it :-) ETA: Your 10 is safe :-) ETA: You''ve been joined by another 10, rare for me. YOU are the most imaginative entry in the challenge hands-down, however :-) I want to give you my rarely-awarded Golden Paw: ', '2017-10-12 23:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539010, 1206402, 30861, '<td valign="top">If this is roflmao''s, you''re getting better: if it ISN''T, he''ll prolly come after you with torches &amp; pitchforks :-)<br/> <br/>ETA: this is one of two 10s I awarded to this challenge :-)</td>', 'If this is roflmao''s, you''re getting better: if it ISN''T, he''ll prolly come after you with torches & pitchforks :-) ETA: this is one of two 10s I awarded to this challenge :-)', '2017-10-12 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539011, 1205922, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like the title.</td>', 'I like the title.', '2017-10-12 23:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539012, 1206242, 30861, '<td valign="top">Endearingly vintage, the central figure is perfect. Brings back memories. A 9 from me, commenting only right now.</td>', 'Endearingly vintage, the central figure is perfect. Brings back memories. A 9 from me, commenting only right now.', '2017-10-12 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539013, 1206407, 68504, '<td valign="top">I have always wondered. oh my.</td>', 'I have always wondered. oh my.', '2017-10-12 23:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539014, 1206391, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is UTTERLY tall, to the point of being vertiginous. It''s a hell of a shot. Slightly too-harsh processing (see how crispy-haloed the figure is?) kept this from a 10. I gave it a 9 earlier, commenting now.</td>', 'This is UTTERLY tall, to the point of being vertiginous. It''s a hell of a shot. Slightly too-harsh processing (see how crispy-haloed the figure is?) kept this from a 10. I gave it a 9 earlier, commenting now.', '2017-10-12 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539015, 1206423, 68504, '<td valign="top">a lovely almost campy take on nostalgia.</td>', 'a lovely almost campy take on nostalgia.', '2017-10-12 23:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539016, 1206242, 68504, '<td valign="top">nice treatment, and the wondering girl.</td>', 'nice treatment, and the wondering girl.', '2017-10-12 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539017, 1206300, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love it, but there are enough ways it falls short that I gave it an 8. In particular, I''m bugged by how the child''s sweatshirt is more dramatically lit than the city he is in, and also by his strange relationship to the ground. But a wonderful vision, I expect it to be on the front page.</td>', 'I love it, but there are enough ways it falls short that I gave it an 8. In particular, I''m bugged by how the child''s sweatshirt is more dramatically lit than the city he is in, and also by his strange relationship to the ground. But a wonderful vision, I expect it to be on the front page.', '2017-10-12 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539018, 1206154, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of your better-lit Meese, sir :-)<br/> <br/>ETA: They certainly are TALL critters, and you have nailed that. I gave it an 8 earlier, and am adding to my comment now.</td>', 'One of your better-lit Meese, sir :-) ETA: They certainly are TALL critters, and you have nailed that. I gave it an 8 earlier, and am adding to my comment now.', '2017-10-12 23:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539019, 1206394, 30861, '<td valign="top">They do indeed, and it''s terrifying. Commenting only now, gave you an 8 earlier. Creepy-fine image of panic and/or vertigo.</td>', 'They do indeed, and it''s terrifying. Commenting only now, gave you an 8 earlier. Creepy-fine image of panic and/or vertigo.', '2017-10-12 23:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7539020, 1206417, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. All in all, I''d have preferred to see it halfway between "real" and the effect you have used: I think you''ve overcooked the filter. Of course, I''m not one to throw stones, since I''m frequently guilty of same :-) anyway, I gave this a 7.</td>', 'I like this picture. All in all, I''d have preferred to see it halfway between "real" and the effect you have used: I think you''ve overcooked the filter. Of course, I''m not one to throw stones, since I''m frequently guilty of same :-) anyway, I gave this a 7.', '2017-10-12 23:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
